            "review_title": "Review at Deme Brewing Taproom",
            "review_text": "Liger Pham\n15 contributions\n1\nA nice place to explore the youth cultures of Vietnam.\nJan 2025 • Friends\nA very cool, fusioned culture hub for young Vietnamese and expats, have a distintive graphic design-led decoration and style. The food is also fusion between Vietnamese food and other cuisine like Mexican, French and The U.S. They also have a mall rooftop for people that love sunset, even though its right in the centre of the city, it has its own unique vibe for sunset lovers. \n\nSometimes they turn into a music venue for indie youth scence here in Saigon, some crafting classes and workshops too.\n\nWould recommend for anyone that interested in exploring youth sub-cultures in Saigon, Vietnam.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nThe place is a bit hidden inside an alley of a crowded street so look closely!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 6, 2025",
